{"ref":"BDB, יוֹעָשׁ","hw":"יוֹעָשׁ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹעָשׁ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> 𝔊 Ἰωας <strong>(</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>hath aided</em> (?; cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">غَاثَ</span>; comp. Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">אלעֿותֿ</span> DHM in MV<strong>)—</strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  a Benjamite, son of Becher <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.8\">1 Ch 7:8</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  an officer under David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.28\">1 Ch 27:28</a>.","next":"BDB, יוֹצָדָק","prev":"BDB, יוֹעֶ֫זֶר"}